{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026GaoNL8EzJN1788094050.jpg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日本一個遊樂場有設施故障，11名遊客被困約半小時。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">周日下午三時許，名古屋市港區的樂高樂園內，供遊客乘坐欣賞魚群的潛水艇型車廂發生故障，無法開門，11名遊客包括兒童被困，約半小時後消防員到場破門，將全部人救出，警方稱沒有人受傷或不適。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.PARK 2300 NHK_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026NnMjivnv611788094487.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.PARK 2300 NHK_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T12:58:15.091254+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}